SUBCOMMITTEE ON WORKFORCE PROTECTIONS hearing at 10:00 a.m. in room 2175 Rayburn House Office Building.

Hearing on H.R. 548, Certainty in Enforcement Act of 2015; 
H.R. 549, Litigation Oversight Act of 2015; H.R. 550, EEOC Transparency and Accountability Act; 
and H.R. 1189, Preserving Employee Wellness Programs Act. 
Witnesses to be announced.
